# Bot1 mills Bot2's Creeping Chill: "your graveyard from your library" is its owner's, so Bot2 gets the trigger and the
# drain goes against Bot1 (Bot2 gains 3), Bot1's own Creeping Chill staying in its library untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Thought Scour
Island x6
Creeping Chill
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Creeping Chill
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Accept
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 17
Bot2.Life = 23
Exile = Creeping Chill
